@startuml
' Figure 6.5  The asynchronous rebooking path
' Reading order: top to bottom. The agent acts inside its limit and
' tells the customer; a refusal within 24 hours goes to a queue that
' a person works later.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent\nloop" as L <<ops>>
participant "Policy\nengine" as P <<policy>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<ops>>
actor "Agent\ndesk" as D <<org>>
L -> P : Rebook
P -[#1A1A1A]> G : Permission
G -> L : Effect record
L -> L : Notify
...24 hours to refuse...
L -[$TRAIL]-> D : Refusal queued
@enduml
